# Holds committed `EvalReport` artefacts produced by `marketplace-eval-llm.yml`.
#
# Each successful 04:30 UTC LLM eval run writes one JSON file here named
# `marketplace-llm-<YYYY-MM-DD>.json`. The file's also uploaded as a
# 90-day artifact, but a copy lives in-repo so the cost dashboard
# generator (`scripts/marketplace-cost-dashboard.ts`) and the WoW gates
# in the workflow have a stable read path that doesn't depend on
# Actions artifact retention.
#
# Keep this file present so the directory exists in fresh clones.
